 pcsx2/GS/Renderers/HW/GSRendererHW.cpp   | 74 +++++++++++++++++++++++-
 pcsx2/GS/Renderers/Vulkan/GSDeviceVK.cpp | 49 ++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 125 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

